//ds.canonical.com/hasTokenBinding> _:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e .\n_:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e <https://ds.canonical.com/consumesSymbol> <https://dt.canonical.com/color.foreground.primary.active> .\n_:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e <https://ds.canonical.com/rank> \"1\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e <https://anatomy.canonical.com/styleState> \"active\" .\n_:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e <https://anatomy.canonical.com/styleKey> \"appearance.background\" .\n_:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e <https://ds.canonical.com/node> \"$root\" .\n_:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e <https://ds.canonical.com/viaBlock> <https://ds.canonical.com/global.component.button> .\n_:d5291a0557afddb8274dcfc6748a3d1e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ds.canonical.com/TokenBinding> .\n<https://ds.canonical.com/global.component.button> <https://ds.canonical.com/hasTokenBinding> _:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 .\n_:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 <https://ds.canonical.com/consumesSymbol> <https://dt.canonical.com/color.foreground.primary.hover> .\n_:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 <https://ds.canonical.com/rank> \"1\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .\n_:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 <https://anatomy.canonical.com/styleState> \"hover\" .\n_:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 <https://anatomy.canonical.com/styleKey> \"appearance.background\" .\n_:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 <https://ds.canonical.com/node> \"$root\" .\n_:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 <https://ds.canonical.com/viaBlock> <https://ds.canonical.com/global.component.button> .\n_:a3145815f2568ff39d67d9c081930139 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ds.canonical.com/TokenBinding> .\n<https://ds.canonical.com/global.component.button> <https://ds.canonical.com/hasTokenBinding> _:ac3bab0c2f6ba2a99d61e459a97707a1 .\n_:ac3bab0c2f6ba2a99d61e459a97707a1 <https://ds.canonical.com/consumesSymbol> <https://